{"4274030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Travelers", "steam_appid": 4274030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travelers is a dark fantasy open-world adventure about exploring the lands beyond the Empire’s great wall — alone or with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exiled into a dangerous medieval frontier, you enter a lawless region filled with castles, ruins, caves, enemies, and secrets. Raid forgotten places, gather wealth, survive the journey, and maybe buy your way back home — if the darkness beyond the wall does not kill you first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current focus:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with friends in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between first-person and third-person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal physical combat with kicks, ragdolls, melee weapons, arrows, and guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use movement, aiming, positioning, and the environment instead of lock-on combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore castles, ruins, caves, forests, mountains, and a dark medieval frontier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light survival elements like hunger and thirst</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world shaped together with the community during development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelers is still early and constantly evolving, but the goal is clear: a physical, dark fantasy co-op adventure with the kind of details I always missed in other games.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travelers is a dark fantasy open-world adventure about exploring the lands beyond the Empire’s great wall — alone or with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exiled into a dangerous medieval frontier, you enter a lawless region filled with castles, ruins, caves, enemies, and secrets. Raid forgotten places, gather wealth, survive the journey, and maybe buy your way back home — if the darkness beyond the wall does not kill you first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current focus:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with friends in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between first-person and third-person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal physical combat with kicks, ragdolls, melee weapons, arrows, and guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use movement, aiming, positioning, and the environment instead of lock-on combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore castles, ruins, caves, forests, mountains, and a dark medieval frontier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light survival elements like hunger and thirst</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world shaped together with the community during development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelers is still early and constantly evolving, but the goal is clear: a physical, dark fantasy co-op adventure with the kind of details I always missed in other games.</p>", "short_description": "The playtest is free and open to everyone until the demo release! Explore a dark medieval frontier alone or with friends, raid castles and ruins, gather wealth, and fight with brutal physics-driven combat where kicks, ragdolls, weapons, and the environment all matter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274030/ac27112df91a03bbeb8153045cee7adb629861ff/header.jpg?t=1786831385", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274030/29ee5b9f40bce123f749f5f97ae3bb8379e15ef9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786831385", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/42740